  "notes": "USAGE:\nA very common word in business, legal, and administrative Japanese. The compound {確定|かくてい}{申告|しんこく} (final tax return) is one of the most well-known collocations and is relevant to anyone working or living in Japan.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {確定|かくてい}{申告|しんこく}: final tax return\n- {確定|かくてい}{判決|はんけつ}: final verdict\n- {日程|にってい}が{確定|かくてい}する: the schedule is finalized\n- {結果|けっか}が{確定|かくてい}する: the results are confirmed\n- {予約|よやく}を{確定|かくてい}する: to confirm a reservation",
